ation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"0","y":"-270","z":"0"}],"uuid":"17dd246c-16ca-5cb3-9221-00c1fbe50ea4","time":4.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":"0","y":"-360","z":"0"}],"uuid":"a3230035-ca2d-5c10-ac9e-db3d091d7a4e","time":6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"0","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"54e3863b-9b62-53c3-b078-47de18af2cbe","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"0","y":"2","z":"0"}],"uuid":"efeb8ef0-7895-51b8-91bf-4d5cc55a5f7c","time":3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"0","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"01c6e7ac-ac01-50c9-82b0-2de7f6e6223d","time":6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# magi_sanctum\n\n- Cubes: finished 753, construction_0 56, construction_33 160, construction_66 259, ruined 211 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: an octagonal tower of pale blue-grey stone on a stepped base with a stone porch, under a steep violet slate spire with silver ribs. Glowing cyan runes run up the walls between arched lit windows, a balcony carries braziers and a player-colour banner, and a large mana crystal floats above the spire in an iron ring. Around the cobbled court: a herb garden, a cauldron, an armillary sphere, a potion shelf, crystal pedestals, lamps and ivy.\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `magi_sanctum_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Clips\n\n- `working` (6.0 s, loop): the floating crystal turns once and bobs 2 u.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -60)\n- `slot_balcony` at (0, 141, -40)\n- `fx_magic` at (0, 283, 0)\n- `fx_brazier_1` at (-37.3, 151, 0)\n- `fx_brazier_2` at (37.3, 151, 0)\n- `fx_lantern_1` at (-27, 24.6, -58)\n- `fx_lantern_2` at (27, 24.6, -58)\n- `fx_cauldron` at (-53, 18, -52)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-26.6, 54, -26.6)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-37.6, 54, 0)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-26.6, 54, 26.6)\n- `fx_window_4` at (26.6, 54, 26.6)\n- `fx_window_5` at (37.6, 54, 0)\n- `fx_window_6` at (26.6, 54, -26.6)\n- `fx_window_7` at (0, 116, -33.6)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-33.6, 116, 0)\n- `fx_window_9` at (0, 116, 33.6)\n- `fx_window_10` at (33.6, 116, 0)\n- `fx_window_11` at (-20.9, 153.5, -20.9)\n- `fx_window_12` at (-29.6, 153.5, 0)\n- `fx_window_13` at (-20.9, 153.5, 20.9)\n- `fx_window_14` at (0, 153.5, 29.6)\n- `fx_window_15` at (20.9, 153.5, 20.9)\n- `fx_window_16` at (29.6, 153.5, 0)\n- `fx_window_17` at (20.9, 153.5, -20.9)"}